# Medical Disclaimer

This repository is intended solely for educational and informational purposes.

The metabolic model presented here reflects the author's personal experience living with diabetes together with publicly available physiological knowledge.

It is NOT intended to:

- diagnose disease;
- recommend treatment;
- replace professional medical advice;
- replace consultation with an endocrinologist or physician.

Every patient is unique.

Any medical decision should be made only after consultation with a qualified healthcare professional.

If you have diabetes or suspect you may have diabetes, consult your physician before making any change to your therapy, nutrition, or lifestyle.
